Follow the UI patterns and theming rules in `agents/project/ui-patterns.md`.

Key reminders:
- Use `GCView` and `GCText` instead of raw `View` and `Text`
- Use `SafeAreaView` from `react-native-safe-area-context` (not the deprecated core version)
- Use react-native-paper for new core components when `uiElements` doesn't have a suitable option
